WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.298
"Emmy," called Dad.

2
00:00:18.299 --> 00:00:21.163
"Rover needs a walk."

3
00:00:21.164 --> 00:00:25.095
"I want to play soccer," said Emmy.

4
00:00:25.096 --> 00:00:36.129
"You can play later," said Dad.

5
00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:41.366
Emmy got Rover's leash.

6
00:00:41.367 --> 00:00:48.513
She took Rover outside.

7
00:00:48.514 --> 00:00:52.200
Rover saw a cat.

8
00:00:52.201 --> 00:00:56.488
He wanted to chase it.

9
00:00:56.489 --> 00:01:00.157
"No, Rover!" Emmy said.

10
00:01:00.158 --> 00:01:04.151
She pulled Rover away.

11
00:01:04.152 --> 00:01:09.096
Rover saw a garden.

12
00:01:09.097 --> 00:01:15.590
He wanted to dig in it.

13
00:01:15.591 --> 00:01:19.711
"No, Rover!" Emmy said.

14
00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:25.002
She pulled Rover away.

15
00:01:25.003 --> 00:01:32.094
Rover saw some trash.

16
00:01:32.095 --> 00:01:34.934
He wanted to eat it.

17
00:01:34.935 --> 00:01:38.584
"No, Rover!" Emmy said.

18
00:01:38.585 --> 00:01:47.077
She pulled Rover away.

19
00:01:47.078 --> 00:01:50.150
Then Rover heard something.

20
00:01:50.151 --> 00:01:53.807
He wagged his tail.

21
00:01:53.808 --> 00:01:59.068
He started to run.

22
00:01:59.069 --> 00:02:02.810
Rover pulled the leash out of Emmy's hands.

23
00:02:02.811 --> 00:02:09.106
"Come back, Rover!" Emmy cried.

24
00:02:09.107 --> 00:02:11.966
Rover did not come back.

25
00:02:11.967 --> 00:02:14.936
He ran down the sidewalk.

26
00:02:14.937 --> 00:02:18.123
Emmy ran after him.

27
00:02:18.124 --> 00:02:21.904
Rover ran into the park.

28
00:02:21.905 --> 00:02:26.238
There were lots of kids there.

29
00:02:26.239 --> 00:02:29.879
They were playing soccer.

30
00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:34.830
Rover wanted to play too.

31
00:02:34.831 --> 00:02:38.133
"No, Rover!" Emmy said.

32
00:02:38.134 --> 00:02:41.544
It was too late.

33
00:02:41.545 --> 00:02:44.827
Rover chased the ball.

34
00:02:44.828 --> 00:02:50.218
He chased it right into a goal!

35
00:02:50.219 --> 00:02:57.745
The kids all laughed.

36
00:02:57.746 --> 00:03:04.252
"Your dog is a good soccer player," one kid said.

37
00:03:04.253 --> 00:03:07.471
Emmy looked at Rover.

38
00:03:07.472 --> 00:03:10.735
He wagged his tail.

39
00:03:10.736 --> 00:03:15.353
"You did not want a walk, Rover," said Emmy.

40
00:03:15.354 --> 00:03:24.594
"You wanted to play soccer too!"
